            "quote": "Neuregulin 4 (Nrg4) knockout (Nrg4-/-), and BAT transplantation were used to evaluate the role of BAT-secreted Nrg4 in bone homeostasis. In vitro experiments were performed to explore the effects of Nrg4 on osteoclastogenesis and the angiogenesis-osteogenesis coupling. Additionally, exogenous Nrg4 treatment was applied to ovariectomy (OVX)-induced osteoporotic mice to assess its therapeutic potential. BAT removal or Nrg4 knockout resulted in increased bone resorption and decreased bone formation, thereby accelerating bone loss in mice; conversely, BAT transplantation rescued the skeletal phenotype of Nrg4-/- mice.",
